    {
      "name": "Black Market Connections",
      "reason": "The repeatable draw engine the board asked for: every first main phase it can draw a card, make a Treasure, and hire a 3/2 changeling. The changeling is every creature type — including Army — so amass counters can land on it, and Sauron verifies: whenever an Army you control deals combat damage to a player, the Ring tempts you. As an enchantment it dodges most removal aimed at this deck. Board-approved add 2026-08-17 (round 4).",
